              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanka jwa nthîgûrû yaao jwaumaga Helefu jûgakinya muuruune jwa Zaananimu, jûgakûrûka jûgeetîîra Adami-nekebu, na Jabuneeli mwanka Lakumu na jûkathirîra Jorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
